{'question': 'A redirect Location points to an unrelated domain. What should you suspect?', 'choices': ['An open redirect or compromised app', 'A fast redirect', 'A pretty link', 'A long URL'], 'answer': 0, 'explain': 'Unexpected redirects are a classic flaw.'},
