{'question': 'A response uses X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN. What does that prevent?', 'choices': ["Clickjacking in other sites' frames", 'Slow pages', 'Long frames', 'Pretty pages'], 'answer': 0, 'explain': 'X-Frame-Options blocks framing by other origins.'},
