{'question': 'A response lacks X-Content-Type-Options. What is the risk?', 'choices': ['MIME sniffing attacks', 'Slow pages', 'Long pages', 'Pretty pages'], 'answer': 0, 'explain': 'The nosniff option blocks MIME sniffing.'},
{'question': 'A referrer header leaks a reset token to a third party. What is the flaw?', 'choices': ['Sensitive URLs in the referrer', 'Long referrers', 'Fast pages', 'Pretty pages'], 'answer': 0, 'explain': 'Tokens in URLs leak via referrers.'},
