{'question': "A report says 'data may have been exposed' but has no proof of exposure. How should it be phrased?", 'choices': ['As an observation with the evidence stated', 'As a proven breach', 'As a guess', 'As a joke'], 'answer': 0, 'explain': 'Observations must stay tied to evidence.'},
